  "title": "Baked Round Steak in Barbecue Sauce",
  "description": "Thick-cut strips of round steak are baked in a tangy, mouthwatering barbecue sauce in this family-tested recipe that was passed down through the generations.",
  "authors": [
    "Jamie Loman Verhoff"
  ],
